00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:02.020
in orbit.

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:04.960
While Canada's strengthens its space sector,

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:07.440
a bright comment offers an easy target

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.660
