00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.720
Operators and astronomers are beginning discussions

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:26.640
on mitigation strategies before the first launches.

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.560
The proposed orbital data centers

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:32.540
would introduce new sources of both point source glare

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.300
and diffuse scattered light.

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:37.620
From sky interference, we turn to corporate changes

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.460
